1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,600
The government called them infected.

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:03,750
The media called them zombies.

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,200
But nobody could explain what they were doing.

4
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:08,200
They didn't chase anyone.

5
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:09,600
They didn't attack.

6
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:11,500
They simply started walking.

7
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:14,800
By sunrise, there were thousands of them.

8
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,750
All moving in the same direction.

9
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:19,350
Authorities initially believed it was an evacuation.

10
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:21,700
Then they realized something was wrong.

11
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:24,800
Every group was heading toward the same place.

12
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
An abandoned field twelve kilometers outside Greyhaven.

13
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:31,800
Investigator Elias Ward was sent to find out why.

14
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:35,000
When he arrived, hundreds of them were already there.

15
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:36,500
Then they started digging.

16
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:37,850
No one told them to.

17
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:39,350
They simply began.

18
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:41,300
For six hours, they kept digging.

19
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:42,800
They never stopped to rest.

20
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:44,700
They never spoke.

21
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:46,800
Ward finally noticed something.

22
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:48,600
The holes weren't random.

23
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:50,600
They were forming a pattern.

24
00:00:51,450 --> 00:00:54,500
Geological scans revealed something beneath the field.

25
00:00:55,450 --> 00:00:58,200
Something that wasn't on any modern map.

26
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:01,000
The structure had been documented once before.

27
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:03,300
In 1968.

28
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:06,200
Then the record disappeared.

29
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:09,000
Then... without warning...

30
00:01:10,050 --> 00:01:10,650
they stopped.

31
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:13,200
Ward looked into the hole.

32
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:15,650
And found something underneath.

33
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:18,800
Something that had been buried for decades.

34
00:01:20,150 --> 00:01:21,850
The infected weren't looking for food.

35
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:24,200
They weren't trying to escape.

36
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:26,400
They were looking for something.

37
00:01:27,700 --> 00:01:29,500
And whatever was buried beneath Greyhaven...

38
00:01:30,950 --> 00:01:32,400
...they knew exactly where to find it.

39
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:37,350
Some mysteries don't come looking for us.
